          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Terrorspores"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, emotion, fear, inhaled, mental, poison)\n\n60 feet. A creature that enters the emanation must attempt a DC 21 Will save. Regardless of outcome, the creature is temporarily immune to terrorspores for 1 minute.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature is frightened 1 and inhales spores that remain in its body for 1 minute.\nFailure: As success, but frightened 2 and the spores remain for 1 hour.\nCritical Failure: As success, but frightened 3, the spores remain for 1 hour, and the creature's frightened condition can't be reduced below 1 as long as spores remain in its body."
            },
